  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Mapbox -- the leading developer platform for custom maps, navigation, and geo-spatial analytics. Visualises OASIS avatars, holons, and Our World/One World data on Mapbox GL maps with custom styling, 3D terrain, and real-time overlays. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
